# Ignition deployment journals — local-only (never committed). The local journal is ephemeral
# (demo:reset clears it); the testnet journal (matura-bsctestnet) stays local too — a redeploy
# mints fresh addresses, and the committed `packages/chain/src/deployments/97.json` manifest is
# the source of truth (not this journal). See docs/deployment-runbook.md.
packages/contracts/ignition/deployments/

